  "description": "Wildstreet is a graffiti-style font inspired by the raw, energetic markings found on real urban walls.\nDesigned by an authentic street artist with years of hands-on graffiti experience, this typeface captures the true spirit of street culture, bold, gritty, and undeniably real, giving your designs an edgy realism that stands out effortlessly.\nDespite its wild street aesthetic, Wildstreet is incredibly easy to use across various design projects. It’s an excellent choice for themes related to street art, hip-hop, urban grunge, or any creative work that needs a strong underground vibe.\nWhile the font is highly versatile, I still recommend adjusting kerning and baseline settings to perfectly match your personal style and visual goals.\nThe font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.",
  "fullDescription": "<p><strong>Wildstreet is a graffiti-style font inspired by the raw, energetic markings found on real urban walls.</strong></p>\n<p>Designed by an authentic street artist with years of hands-on graffiti experience, this typeface captures the true spirit of street culture, bold, gritty, and undeniably real, giving your designs an edgy realism that stands out effortlessly.</p>\n<p>Despite its wild street aesthetic, Wildstreet is incredibly easy to use across various design projects. It’s an excellent choice for themes related to street art, hip-hop, urban grunge, or any creative work that needs a strong underground vibe.</p>\n<p>While the font is highly versatile, I still recommend adjusting kerning and baseline settings to perfectly match your personal style and visual goals.</p>\n<p>The font is also PUA-encoded, ensuring effortless access to all glyphs, swashes, and alternate characters to help you customize your creations with ease.</p>",
